  "deletedAt": null,
  "details": "In the upcoming new hub world I would like to see semi-hidden \"good-to-know\" pointers, like mentioning merging meshes and having a low material count on avatars is good for performance or turning off voice prioritization for when listening to a speaker at an event.\nNew users spend a lot of time in the hub so they're bound to come across them in a fun and more interesting way, rather than having them as loading tips or whatever.\nA full list of these pointers would be on the VRC website too somewhere.",
